            &kp C_PIP         &tdr                  &kp C_PREVIOUS           &kp C_PLAY_PAUSE    &kp C_NEXT             &tdb
            &trans            &trans                &kp C_VOLUME_DOWN        &kp C_PAUSE         &kp C_VOLUME_UP        &trans
